# Intermediate Metal build artifacts
*.ir
*.metallib
*.metal.*.c

# NOTE: *.metal.metallib.h ARE tracked — they are required to build on macOS.
# They are generated by the Metal Toolchain:
#   xcrun -sdk macosx metal -c <input>.metal -o <tmp>.air
#   xcrun -sdk macosx metallib <tmp>.air -o <output>.metallib
#   then embedded as C headers via file_to_c or xxd
